menuconfig TORABO_STATUS_LED_EXT
    bool "3-colour extender status LED (BLE profile + split link)"
    depends on ZMK_BLE
    help
      Drive the 3-colour LED on the bmp-boost LED extender (right/central half):
      flash the active BLE profile's colour combo on a profile change, and hold
      red while the left (peripheral) split link is down. Requires the
      torabo-status-led-ext snippet, which defines the tsle_red / tsle_yg /
      tsle_grn gpio nodes. Central-only by nature; harmless elsewhere.
      Default n; enable per build target.

if TORABO_STATUS_LED_EXT

config TORABO_STATUS_LED_EXT_SHOW_MS
    int "Profile-change display duration (ms)"
    default 1500
    help
      How long the profile colour combo stays lit after a profile switch before
      the LED returns to idle (off, or red if the left link is down).

endif # TORABO_STATUS_LED_EXT
